{"id":"006f3fc193351ef4","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension.md","title":"ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Extension","display":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing8-forcing-extension — ZFC Forcing8 Forcing Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (transitive ground model)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in M\">\\(P\\in M\\)</span> (forcing poset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span> (filter)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^P\">\\(M^P\\)</span> (class of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"51e31cce24feee5c\" href=\"?note=51e31cce24feee5c\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md\">../batch09/58-df-p-name.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (name-evaluation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"85bf4cca0e5f1662\" href=\"?note=85bf4cca0e5f1662\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md\">../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (countable transitive ground-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ForcingExtension}\">\\(\\operatorname{ForcingExtension}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S\\)</span> (equivalent four-place predicates defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P)\\land N=\\{x:\\exists\\tau\\in M^P\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land P\\in M\\land\\mathrm{ZfcForcing8GenericFilter}_S(G,M,P)\\land N=\\{x:\\exists\\tau\\in M^P\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension\\text{-}alias} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcing8ForcingExtension}_S(N,M,G,P)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\\to M[G]_P=N\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing8\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}extension\\text{-}notation} \\vdash \\operatorname{ForcingExtension}(N,M,G,P)\\to M[G]_P=N\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The extension consists of evaluations of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>-names in the generic filter; it is not an algebraic field extension.</li>\n<li>The forcing poset is an explicit argument. The former binary operator merged evaluations coming from every poset on which the same set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> happened to be generic and therefore did not denote a single forcing extension.</li>\n<li>The model guard is now part of the formula rather than only prose, so the comprehension is explicitly the evaluation closure of names belonging to a countable transitive ground model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md","status":"resolved","id":"85bf4cca0e5f1662","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-generic-filter.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-p-name.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-p-name.md","status":"resolved","id":"51e31cce24feee5c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","